WEBVTT

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:12.150
<i>They can recreate the world you lived in.</i>

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:15.530
<i>However, there is a condition.</i>

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:22.160
<i>My world was destroyed when the Manifestor Energy ran out of control.</i>

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:29.300
<i>Their condition is that I destroy the Manifestor Engine in this parallel world.</i>

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.630
<i>Then they will recreate my world.</i>

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:37.300
<i>That's right! I have no reason to hesitate!</i>

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:42.390
Destroying the Manifestor Engine is a good thing for this world too!

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.490
<i>How uncouth.</i>

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:02.410
<i>I cannot feel the honesty you once held anymore.</i>

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:05.370
<i>How did it come down to this?</i>

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:12.300
<i>Vow to never oppose me again.</i>

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:15.010
<i>Otherwise I will kill you right now.</i>

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:22.470
<i>This pain is nothing!</i>

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.560
Do it then!

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:29.230
Do it, if you <i>can</i>!

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:38.660
I thought so.

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:45.460
You can punish me all you want, but you can't kill me.

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:49.540
You're just their servant after all.

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:51.170
Now I understand.

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:55.090
You don't know when the Alone will appear either!

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:59.510
<i>How childish. Did you think I would tell you if you provoked me?</i>

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:04.720
<i>But I like your desperation.</i>

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:10.100
<i>What would you do if you knew when and where the next Alone would appear?</i>

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:18.280
If I used multiple arrows on one Alone, it would become very powerful, right?

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:19.570
<i>Correct.</i>

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:25.540
If I could make the first move, I'd risk everything on the next Alone!

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:29.210
I'd use all my arrows before they could get in my way!

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:32.960
<i>Have you forgotten?</i>

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:38.340
<i>If you fire your final arrow, your existence will disappear.</i>

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:42.050
Isn't it the same outcome if I can't destroy the Manifestor Engine?

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:45.850
The next one will be the last.

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:50.560
I'll win the next battle and get back my world.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:38.920
Found it!

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:40.670
Good job, Himawari!

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:45.010
You made use of the bug in the subroutine to hack into the system!

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.260
That's my apprentice for you!

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:50.140
I was just lucky.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:51.180
Dr. Isshiki,

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:54.060
what does this all mean?

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:59.980
Using Himawari's method, we can identify it!

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:00.940
Identify what?

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.650
Remember when we talked about the external interference

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:07.570
related to the sudden transformations of the Alones?

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:11.620
You can identify its source?

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:13.500
Exactly.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:23.340
He—

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.220
Hello!

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.470
Hey!

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:36.520
Ah, Rei!

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:39.480
Um...

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:41.190
Wait!

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:47.700
I was repairing the charm for the back room!

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:49.450
What brings you here?

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:53.660
I'm sorry!

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:58.370
I crushed that tomato the other day.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:03.460
I'm sorry I ruined the food you worked so hard to grow.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.130
Uh...

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.300
You don't have to forgive me.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:10.640
I just wanted to apologize.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:14.020
<i>Otherwise, I wouldn't be able to rest in peace.</i>

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:15.810
See you.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:20.860
Oh, I forgive you! Totally!

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:23.860
Have dinner with us in exchange!

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:25.360
Huh?

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:30.110
You came to apologize about the tomato, right? Then have some!

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:32.950
It wouldn't be fair to the tomatoes otherwise.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:35.540
Fair? To the tomatoes?

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:38.540
Today's also the fourth Sunday of the month, right?

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.880
It's the only day in the month we eat steak!

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:44.710
It's made using my mom's recipe, so it's really good!

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:47.010
So? Sound good, Rei?

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:50.010
Then... Only for a while...

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:52.640
Hurray!

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:55.600
Understood.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.850
I'll request the defense forces' help too.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:00.900
I'm counting on you, Shijou.

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:07.530
But what kind of a creature could be behind powering up the Alones?

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.070
We won't know until we capture them.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:16.740
Dr. Isshiki...

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:25.960
Isn't it about time you told us how you predicted the coming of the Alones

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:29.010
after the incident seven years ago?

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:35.470
I met one during that incident.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.270
It talked to me.

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:44.230
It wasn't by primitive means like words. It used telepathy.

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:47.980
Its intelligence became clear to me then.

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:52.320
They come from a far higher dimension than us.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:56.370
Their fearful intellect has overcome time and space.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:05.840
They wanted to know whether mankind was fit for using the Manifestor Energy,

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:11.420
a power which could throw our entire universe off-balance if misused.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:16.800
So that higher intellect is sending the Alones against us?

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:23.600
I think we're being tested on whether we can handle our own future or not.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:35.820
What?

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:41.160
I'm so happy I get to spend time with you while waiting for Momo's meal.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:43.910
Uh... okay.

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:50.130
You know, when I first saw you, I knew you weren't ordinary!

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:52.420
What did you think about me?

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:58.300
I thought you were weird.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:00.680
You too?

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:05.140
Himawari said the same...

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:08.770
Aoi keeps telling me I'm not weird,

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.690
and Wakaba doesn't say a word...

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:19.490
Eggs! Eggs! Gotta get some eggs!

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:21.490
What's wrong?

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:24.410
I-It's nothing.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:27.330
Let's dig in!

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.130
I'll have some.

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:40.220
It's good!

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:41.560
I know, right!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.730
Momo's steaks are the best!

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:55.360
It's just too good!

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:59.740
Wanna give it a try?

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:01.740
Say "ah"!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.290
How is it?

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:08.870
Say, how is it?

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:09.580
It's great!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.460
Yay, a fellow spirit!

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:14.420
Isn't that great?

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:16.720
Wanna try the mayo special, Rei?

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:17.380
Yeah.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:20.300
I was hoping you'd say that!

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.260
Uh-oh...

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.600
It ran out at the worst possible time.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.060
I'll go check if we have some more.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:31.270
Oh yeah!

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:38.740
We could use my granddad's own mayonnaise-maker, prototype Mayotaro 5S!

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.780
Switch on!

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.330
Now just wait a second, it'll—

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:51.790
Turns out we do—

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:54.340
What happened here?!

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.380
I'm sorry, Rei! Are you okay?

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:02.050
Wh-What is it?

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:06.100
Your face!

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:09.850
Yours too!

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:11.060
Me too?

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.860
You're hopeless.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:19.070
Just finish eating so you can take a bath.

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:21.740
I'll clean up the rest.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.250
Off we go!

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:34.500
Undress faster!

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:37.050
I-I'll do it myself...

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:42.800
Isn't it tight?

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:48.560
Yeah, but this way we don't need as much water and it's warmer together!

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:52.060
You're interested?

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:52.810
Yeah.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:12:00.320
It's proof of who I am.

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:03.410
Look,

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:07.330
I've got a mark too! Right on my butt!

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:08.410
Look!

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:11.830
Yeah, you really do...

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.210
Hey, Rei!

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.720
Stay over tonight.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:22.590
Huh?

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:27.010
It's getting late, and I wanna talk with you some more.

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:28.430
Okay?

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:30.270
Sure.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.890
Hurray!

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:38.610
Good night, Akane, Kuroki.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:39.980
Night!

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:41.320
Good night.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:51.080
That reminds me, Dr. Isshiki was gone today too.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:55.500
Yeah. He's been really busy lately.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:13:02.300
Do you know anything about the four different colored lights that defend the Manifestor Engine?

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:07.300
They wrote about it in the paper, so I guess...

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:11.970
Is it related to Dr. Isshiki?

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:14.640
Do you know what they really are?

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:17.690
N-Nope! No clue!

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:20.400
Is that so? Sorry.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:23.150
I was just curious.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:26.450
I see...

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.700
<i>I don't care who it is anymore.</i>

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:35.160
<i>I'll fulfill my destiny, regardless.</i>

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.960
Hey, Isshiki...

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:45.800
Why did you want to become friends with me?

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:51.470
Well you see, I know your secret.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:55.810
I saw you play with the birds in the morning

00:13:56.390 --> 00:14:00.150
and save that boy at the construction site.

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:06.030
I could just vividly feel that I wanted to be friends with you!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:08.240
I just knew it'd be so much fun!

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:13.450
You became friends with Futaba and Saegusa like that too?

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:14.330
Yeah.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.620
But it's not only me.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:22.840
Aoi, Wakaba, and Himawari said they want to get along with you too.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:26.220
We all want to be friends with you!

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:36.600
Ever since I came here I thought I didn't need...

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:40.150
No, that I <i>mustn't</i> make any friends.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:44.110
That's why I distanced myself.

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:51.370
But you didn't care and kept reaching out to me.

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:54.410
You said you wanted to be friends with me.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:57.870
I was really happy.

00:14:58.830 --> 00:14:59.790
Thanks.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:01.540
Rei...

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:05.670
Today was fun, right? Come over again!

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.010
Promise?

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:31.200
<i>I'm sorry, Isshiki.</i>

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:34.030
<i>I can't keep that promise.</i>

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:39.540
<i>Tomorrow evening, the next Alone will appear.</i>

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:43.920
<i>I'm betting everything on that Alone.</i>

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:48.340
<i>We won't ever meet again.</i>

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:57.930
I'm going out to make deliveries.

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:01.440
Let's have breakfast together when I'm back.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.740
I'm home...

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:17.830
Rei?

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:27.710
Akane!

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:32.470
We have a meeting with the Manifestor Engine administrative board after class.

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:35.720
Okay. But what could it be about?

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.350
There's a new plan.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:41.230
I think they'll explain that.

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:47.230
Morning!

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:50.070
Good bye, Piisuke.

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:51.690
Thanks for staying with me.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:53.360
Take care!

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:03.790
<i>I'm sorry, Isshiki, but...</i>

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:06.880
I must do this.

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:12.880
Right here! This arrow-like projectile powered up the Alone!

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:16.300
The credit goes to Himawari for this discovery!

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:18.390
Good job, Himawari!

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:19.930
You're amazing!

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:22.060
That's our Himawari!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.850
I-It's nothing...

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:26.310
After further analysis,

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:29.190
we've discovered the arrow

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:32.440
interferes with the Manifestor Engine's unique waves.

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:39.990
With this information, we can identify its source the next time one is fired!

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:43.750
The sensors have picked up a warp in space.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.120
It seems an Alone has emerged.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:46.620
Here it comes!

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:57.880
What about the Allied Defense Forces?

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:02.470
A marine platoon and a droid unit have been dispatched already.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:05.980
Listen! We must catch them alive!

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:09.020
Team Vivid, mobilize!

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:09.860
Roger!

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:26.040
Wave interference! An arrow was shot!

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.160
Identify it!

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:31.750
Wakaba!

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.880
Okay! Akane and I will take care of the Alone.

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:37.260
You two go to the source of the arrow!

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.880
Okay!

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:42.010
One more!

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:52.150
<i>How did they know where I was?</i>

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:56.900
Akane!

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:57.780
Okay!

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:14.040
<i>Impossible! Did they follow me?</i>

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:20.220
<i>Maybe since then?</i>

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.010
Operation...

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:24.810
VividGreen!

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.030
Energizing actuator!

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:43.740
Critical Engine output at 200%!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:49.750
VividBlade! Final Operation!

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:57.000
I need to hurry!

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:05.180
No way...

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:12.520
<i>The Defense Force droids cornered the enemy.</i>

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:14.600
<i>You're the closest, Akane!</i>

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:15.650
Okay!

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:21.780
There!

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:30.870
<i>Not yet! It's not over yet!</i>

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:35.250
<i>As long as I have an arrow left... As long as I have at least a one percent chance...</i>

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:54.770
There too?

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.460
Rei?

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:19.090
Isshiki? It was you?

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:20.710
From the beginning?

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:22.960
You knew who I was, didn't you?

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:26.970
I didn't... I didn't, Rei!

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:27.970
Liar!

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:33.270
That's why you wanted to get close to me...

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:36.100
To keep an eye on me.

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:38.520
You never wanted to be friends!

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:41.270
Please, Rei! Trust me!

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:42.780
How?

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:45.570
You've always stood in my way! You're my enemy!

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:48.370
You lied about not knowing who I am!

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:51.450
How can I trust you?

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:55.660
I was happy...

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:58.880
when you told me you wanted to be friends...

00:21:59.840 --> 00:22:02.130
I was really happy...

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:14.890
Rei!

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:20.690
<i>Foolish child.</i>

00:22:26.530 --> 00:22:27.570
Liar...

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:29.570
I didn't...

00:22:30.410 --> 00:22:31.950
Rei, listen...

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:34.700
Liar!

00:24:13.800 --> 00:24:15.350
I knew it would be like this.

00:24:15.350 --> 00:24:17.680
I knew we couldn't be friends.

00:24:18.060 --> 00:24:20.140
It was stupid wishful thinking on my part.

00:24:20.770 --> 00:24:22.600
Next time: From the Bottom of My Heart

00:24:22.980 --> 00:24:24.480
But I won't give up...

00:24:24.480 --> 00:24:26.480
Not until I take my world back!
